@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2D3748
    ActorBorderColor #2D3748
    LifeLineBorderColor #2D3748
    ParticipantBorderColor #2D3748
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BoxBorderColor #A0AEC0
}
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Platform / Infra Producer" as Producer
control "AuthEventLogAdapter\nor InfraEventLogAdapter" as Adapter
control "SystemLogService" as Svc
entity "SystemLogRepository" as Repo
database "Master PostgreSQL" as MasterDB

note over Producer,MasterDB
  FE17-F01 System Log Tracking — ingest only.
  Producers: master auth success/failure, tenant provisioning,
  Hikari pool pressure, unhandled application errors.
  Persistence: Master DB table system_logs (append-only).
  Search UI is FE17-F03. Tenant user-action audit is FE17-F02.
end note

Producer -> Adapter: Emit technical / auth / infra event
activate Adapter
Adapter -> Adapter: Map to SystemLogRecordCommand\n(sanitize message, no secrets)
Adapter -> Svc: record(command)
activate Svc

alt invalid or empty action/message
  Svc --> Adapter: reject (no persistence)
  deactivate Svc
  Adapter --> Producer: drop / local warn only
  deactivate Adapter
else valid command
  Svc -> Svc: Build SystemLog\nlevel, category, optional tenantCode,\nsource, correlationId, occurredAt=now
  Svc -> Repo: save(systemLog)
  activate Repo
  Repo -> MasterDB: INSERT system_logs
  activate MasterDB
  MasterDB --> Repo: id
  deactivate MasterDB
  Repo --> Svc: SystemLog
  deactivate Repo
  Svc --> Adapter: recorded
  deactivate Svc
  Adapter --> Producer: ack (best-effort; fail-open for business path)
  deactivate Adapter
end

note over Svc,MasterDB
  Logging must not break the primary business transaction.
  Prefer fail-open after local warn if Master write fails,
  except when the producer itself is a security-critical audit path
  that product policy marks as fail-closed.
end note

@enduml
